Issues noticed as the app grows:-


1)  Shared state becomes difficult
    Multiple widgets may need the same data.

2)  Data passing becomes complicated
    You may have to pass values and callback functions from parent → child → grandchild.

3)  Prop drilling
    Data has to travel through widgets that don't actually need the data.

4)  Multiple copies of state
    Different widgets may maintain their own versions of the same data.

5)  Synchronization problems
    One widget may update while another widget still has old data.

6)  Code becomes difficult to maintain
    As the number of widgets and setState() calls increases, managing everything becomes harder.
